          How to Convert PDF to Image in 4 Easy Steps
        </h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Operating our <strong>pdf to image converter</strong> is straightforward and requires no technical expertise. Follow this 4-step workflow to export your PDF pages as image files:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          {[
